post.description:
This API creates a Secure PWA™ app from a provided URL for iOS (<code>ipa</code>), Android (<code>aab</code>), or both platforms.
The request completes only after the PWA upload finishes. Use the returned App ID for the subsequent build flow.
<h2>iOS PWA builds</h2>
When <code>pwa_platform</code> is <code>ipa</code> or <code>both</code>, <code>overrides</code> is required and must include a base64-encoded provisioning profile:
<pre>{
  "provisioning_profile": [
    {
      "filename": "[File Name]",
      "content": "[BASE64 CONTENT]"
    }
  ]
}</pre>
<h2>Response</h2>
Returns an array of results (one entry per platform; two entries when <code>pwa_platform</code> is <code>both</code>). Each entry includes an <code>app</code> object with the App ID:
<pre>[
  {
    "app": {
      "id": "5b4a3a56-1137-468e-bb82-375ca89e9b96",
      "pack_type": "ipa",
      "is_pwapp": true,
      "status": "active"
    }
  }
]</pre>
Use <code>app.id</code> with the regular build API to select a Fusion Set and continue the build flow.
